  "notes": "TECHNOLOGY CONTEXT:\n{同期|どうき}する is commonly used in computing and technology contexts:\n- データを{同期|どうき}する - to sync data\n- {自動|じどう}{同期|どうき} - automatic synchronization\n- {同期|どうき}{中|ちゅう} - syncing in progress\n\nRELATED NOUN:\n{同期|どうき} also means \"same period/year\" and refers to people who joined a company or school in the same year. This is a different meaning from the synchronization sense.",
